@startuml
title Certificate Key Rotation Flow with Steps

actor EventBridge
participant "Key-Rotation-Lambda" as Lambda
participant "AWS KMS" as KMS
database "S3 Bucket" as S3
participant "CKMSAPI" as CKMS

== Scheduled Trigger ==

1. EventBridge -> Lambda : Step 1: Trigger every 330 days\n(customerId, keyAlgorithm)

== Key Pair Generation ==

2. Lambda -> KMS : Step 2: Generate RSA Key Pair

== CSR Creation ==

3. Lambda -> Lambda : Step 3: Create CSR file with CN = customerId

== Certificate Existence Check ==

4. Lambda -> CKMS : Step 4: Check if certificate exists (CN)

alt Step 5: Certificate does not exist
    5. Lambda -> CKMS : Step 5: Add new certificate (CSR)
else Step 6: Certificate exists
    6. Lambda -> CKMS : Step 6: Renew certificate (CSR)
end

== Certificate Fetch and Save ==

7. Lambda -> CKMS : Step 7: Fetch latest certificate info (CN)
8. Lambda -> S3 : Step 8: Save certificate details

@enduml
